{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07546","headline":"咏史十一首 八 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文侯耽郑卫，一听一忘餐。\n白雪燕姬舞，朱弦赵女弹。\n淫声流不返，慆荡日无端。\n献岁受朝时，鸣钟讌百官。\n两牀陈管磬，九奏殊未阑。\n对此唯恐卧，更能整衣冠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}